{"id":"wb-4-176","name":"周口关帝庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"周口关帝庙","text":"周口关帝庙位于中国河南省周口市川汇区人和街道富强街，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n周口地处河南省东南部，历史悠久，风光秀丽，沙河、颖河、贾鲁河在市区交汇，三岸鼎立，古为漕运重地，素有“小武汉”之称。明清时期，舟车辐辏，商贾云集。周口关帝庙则是清山西新绛、长治，陕西蒲州、大荔、澄城等地旅周的商人在周集资营建的一座雄伟富丽、具有鲜明地方风格的古建筑群。旧时又称“山陕会馆”，也是周口沙颍三岸商民祭祀武圣关羽的祠庙。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E5%8F%A3%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94457286,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94457286","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b5c67ac7ecc327fab88e5266.jpg","title":"20260913_Zhoukou_Emperor_Guan_Temple_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260913_Zhoukou_Emperor_Guan_Temple_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/20260913_Zhoukou_Emperor_Guan_Temple_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南周口 周口关帝庙","width":320,"height":213}}